{"name":"Thindar","status":"ok","title":"Thindar","pageId":124051,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Thindar</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p131_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p131-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aliases\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The City in the Waves</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Capital</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thindol\" title=\"Thindol\">Thindol</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Chultan_Peninsula\" title=\"Chultan Peninsula\">Chultan Peninsula</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p131_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p131-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">98,662 in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Yuan-ti\" title=\"Yuan-ti\">Yuan-ti</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Thindar\" title=\"Category:Locations in Thindar\">Locations in  Thindar</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Thindar\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Thindar\">Organizations in  Thindar</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Thindar&amp;DPL_cat2=Settlements&amp;action=purge\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Settlements  in  Thindar</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Thindar&amp;DPL_cat2=Mountains&amp;action=purge\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Mountains  in  Thindar</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Thindar&amp;DPL_cat2=Bodies_of_water&amp;action=purge\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Bodies of water  in  Thindar</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Thindar&amp;DPL_cat2=Forests&amp;action=purge\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Forests  in  Thindar</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Events_in_Thindar\" title=\"Category:Events in Thindar\">Events in  Thindar</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Thindar</b> was a large city and the capital of <a href=\"/wiki/Thindol\" title=\"Thindol\">Thindol</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Chultan_Peninsula\" title=\"Chultan Peninsula\">Chultan Peninsula</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p9_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p9-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3.M_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3.M-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p131_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p131-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Activities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Activities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Thindar?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Thindar was located in the center of Thindol along the northwestern shores of the <a href=\"/wiki/Thingulph\" title=\"Thingulph\">Thingulph</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p9_2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p9-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3.M_3-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3.M-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p131_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p131-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Thindar?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Thindar was an unwalled city that sprawled across a marsh that had been filled in. The grasslands surrounding the city shimmered in the sun, giving the illusion that the city was surrounded by water and prompted the nickname the <b>City in the Waves</b>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p131_1-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p131-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Thindar?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Most of the wealthy citizens who dominated Thindar were of <a href=\"/wiki/Tashluta\" title=\"Tashluta\">Tashlutan</a> heritage.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p131_1-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p131-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Activities\">Activities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Activities\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Thindar?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Activities\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Thindar was the center of all trade within the <a href=\"/wiki/Thindol_Basin\" title=\"Thindol Basin\">Thindol Basin</a> and was often the last port of call for any ships sailing west around the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG9ybl9vZl9DaHVsdD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Horn of Chult (page does not exist)\">Horn of Chult</span>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p131_1-6\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p131-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Thindar?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Much of <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Thindar\" title=\"Old Thindar\">Old Thindar</a> was sunk beneath the waves as each storm passing over the city slowly eroded the port district. Aware of the issue, any new construction by the Thindolese occurred on Thindar's north side further from the Thingulph. Brave <a href=\"/wiki/Adventurer\" title=\"Adventurer\">adventurers</a> often tried to search the submerged ruins for hidden treasure but few returned because of the presence of <a href=\"/wiki/Yuan-ti\" title=\"Yuan-ti\">yuan-ti</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p131_1-7\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p131-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Thindar?veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Thindar?veaction=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-SK-p131-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p131_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p131_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p131_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p131_1-3\">1.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p131_1-4\">1.4</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p131_1-5\">1.5</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p131_1-6\">1.6</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p131_1-7\">1.7</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Eric_L._Boyd\" title=\"Eric L. Boyd\">Eric L. Boyd</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Darrin_Drader\" title=\"Darrin Drader\">Darrin Drader</a> (July 2004). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Serpent_Kingdoms\" title=\"Serpent Kingdoms\">Serpent Kingdoms</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 131. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-3277-5\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-3277-5\">0-7869-3277-5</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRA-p9-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRA-p9_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRA-p9_2-1\">2.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karen_Wynn_Fonstad\" title=\"Karen Wynn Fonstad\">Karen Wynn Fonstad</a> (August 1990). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Forgotten_Realms_Atlas\" title=\"The Forgotten Realms Atlas\">The Forgotten Realms Atlas</a></i>. (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 9. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0880388573\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0880388573\">978-0880388573</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCS3.M-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3.M_3-0\">3.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3.M_3-1\">3.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Map included in <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Sean K. Reynolds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Skip_Williams\" title=\"Skip Williams\">Skip Williams</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rob_Heinsoo\" title=\"Rob Heinsoo\">Rob Heinsoo</a> (June 2001). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Setting_3rd_edition\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition\">Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>). ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-1836-5\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-1836-5\">0-7869-1836-5</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260514174530\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.105 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.144 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1145/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8019/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2532/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 12/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3972